[1] mermaid.js stores `BgColor` as a separate attribute; use `bgColor` to set this style.
[2] mermaid.js stores `FontColor` as a separate attribute; use `fontColor` to set this style.
[3] mermaid.js stores `BorderColor` as a separate attribute; use `borderColor` to set this style.
